e-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-174229b4-8ce6-46f1-bc48-317a333fdbc1\">게임을 완전히 종료하신 후 재접속하여</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-246fc003-292d-467a-8104-e31defbd67c0\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-4d4d3b4c-f59d-4340-8436-600bfcbf038b\">업데이트 리소스를 다운로드해 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0e26ad2d-fd56-478d-9129-798cbc3c2a0c\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-42f38438-2bda-4ec9-abf7-880ec1a4522c\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e2195c9d-0572-4ff2-b1a0-e7426ea7b398\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-94f0e7c5-4f97-4e3c-949a-9c13168060f5\">​​자세한 설명은 아래를 확인해 주시기 바랍니다.​​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-6a0de027-3442-4e79-b686-bf659f6b63a9\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-de4d4b11-45ca-4cbe-a9fb-124cc874f25f\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-410366c9-852d-47df-a906-c52761b5e7c1\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-cc2dd6ad-777a-42fb-b3e8-9b041daf8f2d\">​·····················································································</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-914f0ef3-26cb-4bb5-9e1f-2bcf8144ec84\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-03f39625-1f6a-483f-9c54-283ef9b6fe05\"><b>📢 2월 25일(화) 무점검 업데이트 안내​​​​</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e906d845-7073-4def-87b4-bdf2978ed0ee\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-60af214c-03d2-4423-a050-9bfe815ac12f\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-6eda303a-fb86-49ae-b984-4d17621dea0b\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-41fc0d3f-1320-465b-aeb1-c20e49cae03e\"><b>​✔️ 일시</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-59781e9b-fb11-4c77-9709-0a440fa1b007\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-35929f63-6cf7-4c7c-9c9d-7734644533a9\">- 2/25(화) 18:00 ~ 19:00 경​​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-acc65627-33c0-4e74-a1d8-e3884879a707\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-e6df0ef9-0a4d-4e63-9df2-4934b26ab0d9\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-00c872a7-9143-475a-9b13-527167a82ebf\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-3cd085e1-06c7-47b5-8f2c-42a8999ada74\"><b>​✔️ 내용</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ceeb1236-0b58-4350-84fa-a8326c4196ff\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-e8a12b9f-531a-4dee-9ffc-7809af8c9a90\">1.일부 언어의 로컬라이징 이슈를 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9d91e385-9015-4eff-ac12-f1c47fd518e0\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-8c35cdaf-c851-48cb-903c-0da2199c4ff0\">2.아야나미 레이 (가칭) 코스튬 &#x27;제 3마을의 닮은꼴 씨&#x27;의 스탠딩 모션 중 일부 장식물이 어색하게 보이는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-20c17ae8-c4a5-442f-bfe1-f2cf6b164275\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-08f257cd-c951-43c4-aa05-f71aa5fdff40\">3. 헬름 코스튬 &#x27;애프터 샤워&#x27;의 사격 및 스킬 컷신 모션에서 일부 어색하게 보이는 부위를 조정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ed4ba5f1-3c53-4d22-977c-762034f413cd\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-3c7dab6e-a51f-4a63-b241-9a925140768a\">4. 일부 니케의 버스트 스킬 사용 시 사격 모션이 어색하게 보이는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5d870613-9775-48a7-918c-3f44d87c813c\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-b8bf0bcd-60f5-4ad9-92c9-77abb7d3bb10\">└ 사격 속도와 대미지는 정상적으로 적용되고 있습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-6a2e7cdf-94eb-4184-b37a-b50200bcb091\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-7fb8f675-1ab5-449d-95ad-20a2b1131806\">[대상]</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1c61fddf-6b71-46a9-9744-14c296bfc3e1\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-790d074d-831d-45ec-bc43-8a0a66448b0c\">└ 레드 후드</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-903d1e91-414a-484a-9fd4-cecab61da587\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-8b116c3b-7742-4d90-97b8-edde586239ef\">└ 네온 : 블루 오션</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-08e53669-97de-418c-9c96-1247b4a0e4c8\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-5a0af452-606d-43d0-92a6-9fd8df64f0c1\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-bca109b7-4379-467e-928b-6b6e798340e4\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-eaabd1c4-0ea6-47e8-a4b1-5718110b146b\">​​​※ 게임 재접속 후 업데이트 리소스 다운로드를 부탁드립니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-98a2034c-be88-4f47-926c-93a66d6b4034\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-10cf3a41-6424-41ba-9da6-5284bf999758\">​※ 인앱 구매(확률형 아이템 포함)​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-69b4f0d1-1bc6-4a64-a01c-a49852364999\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-a77e0a3f-d29f-4e3d-a363-398585560c35\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-fbc91b52-19c5-4518-9105-5f7a0458840d\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-3f77ea44-5a47-4824-8c11-21a1f4fa7854\">·····················································································​​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-17b52386-dfb5-482c-9ecc-6ea2f79982bc\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-df718fb3-cd71-4f3b-8084-2116630a542c\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9a0d9c7c-7dd6-47e6-a9f9-b4d27849ec6a\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"